<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Tasas de Cambio y Cotizaciones - {{ _ENV['APP_NAME'] }}</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="/resources/images/favicon.jpg">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/resources/styles/w3.css">
  <script defer src="/resources/scripts/alpinejs/dist/cdn.min.js"></script>
  <style>
    :root {
      --brand-red: #dc2626;
      --brand-red-hover: #b91c1c;
      --brand-red-glow: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.25);
      --brand-black: #0d0d11;
      --brand-charcoal: #18181b;
      --sidebar-width: 260px;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background-color: var(--w3-surface-alt);
      color: var(--w3-text-color);
      font-family: var(--w3-font-family);
      margin: 0;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
    }

    body.w3-dark-mode {
      background-color: var(--w3-page-bg);
    }

    /* Sidebar Layout */
    .app-sidebar {
      width: var(--sidebar-width);
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      background-color: var(--brand-black);
      color: #ffffff;
      z-index: 20;
      overflow-y: auto;
      border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .app-main {
      margin-left: var(--sidebar-width);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      transition: margin-left 0.3s ease;
    }

    @media (max-width: 992px) {
      .app-sidebar {
        transform: translateX(-100%);
      }
      .app-sidebar.open {
        transform: translateX(0);
      }
      .app-main {
        margin-left: 0;
      }
    }

    /* Topbar */
    .app-topbar {
      height: 64px;
      background-color: var(--w3-surface);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--w3-border-light);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 24px;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    /* Brand Header in Sidebar */
    .sidebar-brand {
      padding: 20px 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--brand-red);
      background-color: #08080a;
    }

    .brand-avatar {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--brand-red);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 10px var(--brand-red-glow);
    }

    /* Navigation Links */
    .nav-group-title {
      padding: 16px 20px 6px;
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: #71717a;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .nav-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 11px 20px;
      color: #a1a1aa;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      border-left: 3px solid transparent;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .nav-item:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border-left-color: #71717a;
    }

    .nav-item.active {
      color: #ffffff;
      background-color: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.12);
      border-left-color: var(--brand-red);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .nav-item svg {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* Buttons */
    .btn-brand {
      background-color: var(--brand-red);
      color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid var(--brand-red);
      padding: 10px 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-brand:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background-color: var(--brand-red-hover);
      border-color: var(--brand-red-hover);
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .btn-brand:disabled {
      opacity: 0.7;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background-color: transparent;
      color: inherit;
      border: 1px solid var(--w3-border-color);
      padding: 10px 18px;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background-color: var(--w3-hover-bg);
      color: var(--w3-hover-text);
    }

    /* Panel Card */
    .panel-card {
      background-color: var(--w3-surface);
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--w3-border-light);
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .panel-header {
      padding: 18px 22px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--w3-border-light);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    /* Form Inputs */
    .form-group {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .form-label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--w3-text-color);
    }

    .input-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .input-prefix {
      position: absolute;
      left: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #71717a;
      pointer-events: none;
      user-select: none;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .form-input {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: var(--w3-surface-alt);
      color: var(--w3-text-color);
      border: 1px solid var(--w3-border-color);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 12px 16px 12px 58px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      outline: none;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }

    .form-input:focus {
      border-color: var(--brand-red);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--brand-red-glow);
    }

    .form-hint {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #71717a;
      margin-top: 6px;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    /* Badges */
    .badge-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 5px;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 999px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .badge-red {
      background-color: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.15);
      color: var(--brand-red);
      border: 1px solid rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.3);
    }

    .badge-green {
      background-color: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.15);
      color: #22c55e;
      border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.3);
    }

    .badge-blue {
      background-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
      color: #3b82f6;
      border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
    }

    .badge-gray {
      background-color: rgba(113, 113, 122, 0.15);
      color: #a1a1aa;
      border: 1px solid rgba(113, 113, 122, 0.3);
    }

    /* Alert error box */
    .alert-error {
      background-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--brand-red);
      color: #ef4444;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* KPI Cards Grid */
    .kpi-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .kpi-card {
      background-color: var(--w3-surface);
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--w3-border-light);
      padding: 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 14px;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .kpi-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      border-color: var(--brand-red);
    }

    .kpi-icon-box {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .kpi-icon-box.red {
      background-color: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.15);
      color: var(--brand-red);
    }

    .kpi-icon-box.blue {
      background-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
      color: #3b82f6;
    }

    .kpi-icon-box.green {
      background-color: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.15);
      color: #22c55e;
    }

    /* Layout Split */
    .content-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 1024px) {
      .content-layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
        align-items: start;
      }
    }

    /* Simulator Chips */
    .calc-chip {
      background-color: var(--w3-surface-alt);
      border: 1px solid var(--w3-border-light);
      color: var(--w3-text-color);
      padding: 5px 12px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .calc-chip:hover {
      border-color: var(--brand-red);
      color: var(--brand-red);
    }

    .calc-result-box {
      background-color: var(--w3-surface-alt);
      border: 1px solid var(--w3-border-light);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    /* Info Callout */
    .callout-box {
      background-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.08);
      border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
      border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--w3-text-color);
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    /* Overlay for mobile drawer */
    .sidebar-backdrop {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
      z-index: 15;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body
  x-data="{
    isDarkMode: window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches,
    sidebarOpen: false,
    submitting: false,
    rateVes: {{ (exchangeRate and exchangeRate['usd_ves']) ? exchangeRate['usd_ves'] : '0' }},
    rateCop: {{ (exchangeRate and exchangeRate['usd_cop']) ? exchangeRate['usd_cop'] : '0' }},
    testUsd: 10,
    init() {
      const mediaQuery = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)');
      this.isDarkMode = mediaQuery.matches;
      mediaQuery.addEventListener('change', (event) => {
        this.isDarkMode = event.matches;
      });
    },
    formatNumber(num) {
      if (isNaN(num) || num === null || num === undefined) return '0,00';
      return Number(num).toLocaleString('es-VE', { minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 });
    }
  }"
  :class="{ 'w3-dark-mode': isDarkMode }"
>

  <!-- Telón de fondo móvil -->
  <div
    class="sidebar-backdrop"
    x-show="sidebarOpen"
    @click="sidebarOpen = false"
    x-transition:enter="w3-animate-opacity"
    x-transition:leave="w3-animate-opacity"
    style="display: none;"
  ></div>

  <!-- Barra lateral (Sidebar) -->
  <aside class="app-sidebar" :class="{ 'open': sidebarOpen }">
    <div class="sidebar-brand">
      <img
        src="/resources/images/banner.jpg"
        alt="{{ _ENV['APP_NAME'] }}"
        class="brand-avatar"
        onerror="this.style.display='none'"
      >
      <div style="overflow: hidden;">
        <div style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #ffffff; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;">
          {{ _ENV['APP_NAME'] }}
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #a1a1aa; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; margin-top: 2px;">
          <span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #22c55e; display: inline-block;"></span>
          Sistema en línea
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Navegación principal -->
    <nav style="padding: 8px 0 24px;">
      <div class="nav-group-title">Principal</div>

      <a href="/" class="nav-item">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6" />
        </svg>
        <span>Dashboard</span>
      </a>

      <div class="nav-group-title">Gestión de Negocio</div>

      <a href="/clientes" class="nav-item">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
        </svg>
        <span>Clientes</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/proveedores" class="nav-item">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4" />
        </svg>
        <span>Proveedores</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/vendedores" class="nav-item">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z" />
        </svg>
        <span>Vendedores</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/cotizaciones" class="nav-item active">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
        </svg>
        <span>Tasas de Cambio</span>
      </a>

      <div class="nav-group-title">Módulos de Repuestos</div>

      <a href="/productos" class="nav-item">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2" />
        </svg>
        <span>Catálogo de Productos</span>
      </a>

      <a href="#inventario" class="nav-item" @click.prevent="alert('Módulo de inventario y lotes en proceso')">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4" />
        </svg>
        <span>Inventario y Lotes</span>
      </a>

      <a href="#pos" class="nav-item" @click.prevent="alert('Punto de venta y facturación en proceso')">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z" />
        </svg>
        <span>Punto de Venta (POS)</span>
      </a>

      <div class="nav-group-title">Sistema y Seguridad</div>

      <a href="/actualizar-clave" class="nav-item">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
        </svg>
        <span>Actualizar Contraseña</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/salir" class="nav-item" style="color: #ef4444;">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 16l4-4m0 0l-4-4m4 4H7m6 4v1a3 3 0 01-3 3H6a3 3 0 01-3-3V7a3 3 0 013-3h4a3 3 0 013 3v1" />
        </svg>
        <span>Cerrar Sesión</span>
      </a>
    </nav>
  </aside>

  <!-- Área principal (Topbar + Contenido) -->
  <div class="app-main">
    <!-- Topbar -->
    <header class="app-topbar">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="btn-secondary w3-hide-large"
          @click="sidebarOpen = true"
          aria-label="Abrir menú"
        >
          <svg width="20" height="20" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16" />
          </svg>
        </button>

        <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
          <span>Cotizaciones y Divisas</span>
          <span class="badge-pill badge-red w3-hide-small">Multidivisa</span>
        </h1>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="btn-secondary"
          @click="isDarkMode = !isDarkMode"
          :title="isDarkMode ? 'Cambiar a modo claro' : 'Cambiar a modo oscuro'"
          aria-label="Alternar modo de color"
        >
          <svg x-show="isDarkMode" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z" />
          </svg>
          <svg x-show="!isDarkMode" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M20.354 15.354A9 9 0 018.646 3.646 9.003 9.003 0 0012 21a9.003 9.003 0 008.354-5.646z" />
          </svg>
        </button>

        <a href="/salir" class="btn-brand" style="padding: 7px 14px;" title="Cerrar sesión actual">
          <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 16l4-4m0 0l-4-4m4 4H7m6 4v1a3 3 0 01-3 3H6a3 3 0 01-3-3V7a3 3 0 013-3h4a3 3 0 013 3v1" />
          </svg>
          <span class="w3-hide-small">Salir</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Contenido -->
    <main style="padding: 24px; flex: 1;">
      <!-- Migas de pan y encabezado -->
      <div style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
        <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #71717a; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
          <a href="/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: none;">Dashboard</a>
          <span>&rsaquo;</span>
          <span style="color: var(--brand-red); font-weight: 600;">Cotizaciones y Tasas de Cambio</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;">
          <div>
            <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.3px;">
              Configuración de Tasas Oficiales
            </h2>
            <p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #71717a;">
              Gestiona el valor de conversión en Bolívares (VES) y Pesos (COP) para la facturación, punto de venta y presupuestos de repuestos.
            </p>
          </div>
          {% if exchangeRate %}
            <div class="badge-pill badge-green" title="Registro ID #{{ exchangeRate['id'] }}">
              <span style="width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #22c55e;"></span>
              <span>Tasa Activa #{{ exchangeRate['id'] }}</span>
            </div>
          {% else %}
            <div class="badge-pill badge-gray">
              <span>Sin registros previos</span>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tarjetas de Tasas Vigentes (KPIs) -->
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <!-- USD / VES -->
        <div class="kpi-card">
          <div>
            <div style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: #71717a; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">
              Tasa USD &rarr; VES (Bolívares)
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; margin: 6px 0 2px; color: var(--w3-text-color);">
              {% if exchangeRate and exchangeRate['usd_ves'] %}
                Bs. {{ exchangeRate['usd_ves']|number_format(2, ',', '.') }}
              {% else %}
                <span style="color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 20px;">No configurada</span>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #71717a;">
              1 USD = <strong style="color: var(--brand-red);">{{ exchangeRate ? exchangeRate['usd_ves'] : '0.00' }}</strong> VES
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="kpi-icon-box red" title="Bolívares Venezolanos">
            <span style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800;">VES</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- USD / COP -->
        <div class="kpi-card">
          <div>
            <div style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: #71717a; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">
              Tasa USD &rarr; COP (Pesos Colombianos)
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; margin: 6px 0 2px; color: var(--w3-text-color);">
              {% if exchangeRate and exchangeRate['usd_cop'] %}
                $ {{ exchangeRate['usd_cop']|number_format(2, ',', '.') }}
              {% else %}
                <span style="color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 20px;">No configurada</span>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #71717a;">
              1 USD = <strong style="color: #3b82f6;">{{ exchangeRate ? exchangeRate['usd_cop'] : '0.00' }}</strong> COP
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="kpi-icon-box blue" title="Pesos Colombianos">
            <span style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800;">COP</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Estado y Fecha de Vigencia -->
        <div class="kpi-card">
          <div>
            <div style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: #71717a; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">
              Última Modificación
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; margin: 8px 0 4px; color: var(--w3-text-color);">
              {% if exchangeRate and exchangeRate['created_at'] %}
                {{ exchangeRate['created_at'] }}
              {% else %}
                Sin actualizaciones
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #71717a; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;">
              <span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #22c55e;"></span>
              <span>Aplica a ventas y presupuestos</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="kpi-icon-box green">
            <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Diseño Principal: Formulario + Simulador en tiempo real -->
      <div class="content-layout">
        <!-- Columna Izquierda: Formulario de Actualización -->
        <div>
          <div class="panel-card">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                <span style="width: 4px; height: 18px; background-color: var(--brand-red); border-radius: 2px;"></span>
                <span>Fijar Nuevas Tasas de Cambio</span>
              </div>
              <span class="badge-pill badge-red">Formulario Oficial</span>
            </div>

            <div style="padding: 24px;">
              <!-- Notificación de Errores Flash -->
              {% if flash %}
                <div class="alert-error">
                  <div style="font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
                    <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
                    </svg>
                    <span>Atención al guardar la cotización:</span>
                  </div>
                  {% for key, error in flash %}
                    <div>&bull; {{ error is iterable ? error|join(', ') : error }}</div>
                  {% endfor %}
                </div>
              {% endif %}

              <form
                method="post"
                novalidate
                @submit="submitting = true"
              >
                <!-- Campo USD -> VES -->
                <div class="form-group">
                  <label for="usd_ves" class="form-label">
                    Tasa USD &rarr; VES (Bolívares) <span style="color: var(--brand-red);">*</span>
                  </label>
                  <div class="input-wrapper">
                    <span class="input-prefix">Bs.</span>
                    <input
                      type="number"
                      step="any"
                      min="0.0001"
                      id="usd_ves"
                      name="usd_ves"
                      value="{{ exchangeRate ? exchangeRate['usd_ves'] : '' }}"
                      class="form-input"
                      x-model.number="rateVes"
                      required
                      placeholder="Ej. 36.50"
                      autofocus
                    >
                  </div>
                  <div class="form-hint">
                    Indica el tipo de cambio oficial (ej. Banco Central de Venezuela) para calcular los precios de venta en Bolívares.
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Campo USD -> COP -->
                <div class="form-group">
                  <label for="usd_cop" class="form-label">
                    Tasa USD &rarr; COP (Pesos Colombianos) <span style="color: var(--brand-red);">*</span>
                  </label>
                  <div class="input-wrapper">
                    <span class="input-prefix">$ COP</span>
                    <input
                      type="number"
                      step="any"
                      min="0.01"
                      id="usd_cop"
                      name="usd_cop"
                      value="{{ exchangeRate ? exchangeRate['usd_cop'] : '' }}"
                      class="form-input"
                      x-model.number="rateCop"
                      required
                      placeholder="Ej. 4150.00"
                    >
                  </div>
                  <div class="form-hint">
                    Tasa de referencia para operaciones comerciales y ventas transfronterizas en Pesos Colombianos.
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Nota informativa -->
                <div class="callout-box">
                  <div style="font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 2px;">Trazabilidad e Historial Inmutable:</div>
                  Al guardar, se registrará un nuevo punto de cambio con fecha y hora. Las ventas y presupuestos cerrados anteriormente mantendrán su tasa histórica sin alterarse.
                </div>

                <!-- Acciones del Formulario -->
                <div style="margin-top: 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--w3-border-light); padding-top: 20px;">
                  <a href="/" class="btn-secondary">
                    Cancelar
                  </a>
                  <button
                    type="submit"
                    class="btn-brand"
                    :disabled="submitting || !rateVes || !rateCop"
                  >
                    <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v9a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-3m-1 4l-3 3m0 0l-3-3m3 3V4" />
                    </svg>
                    <span x-text="submitting ? 'Guardando...' : 'Actualizar Tasas'"></span>
                  </button>
                </div>
              </form>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Columna Derecha: Calculadora Simulador en Vivo -->
        <div>
          <!-- Simulador Interactivo -->
          <div class="panel-card">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" style="color: var(--brand-red);">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                </svg>
                <span>Simulador de Cotización Rápida</span>
              </div>
              <span class="badge-pill badge-blue">En Vivo</span>
            </div>

            <div style="padding: 22px;">
              <p style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 13px; color: #71717a;">
                Prueba cómo se calcularán los precios al mostrador utilizando los valores introducidos en el formulario:
              </p>

              <!-- Monto Base en USD -->
              <div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
                <label for="calc_usd" class="form-label" style="font-size: 12px;">
                  Precio de Prueba en Repuesto (USD $)
                </label>
                <div class="input-wrapper">
                  <span class="input-prefix">$ USD</span>
                  <input
                    type="number"
                    step="any"
                    id="calc_usd"
                    class="form-input"
                    x-model.number="testUsd"
                    min="0"
                    placeholder="10.00"
                  >
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Atajos de montos -->
              <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <button type="button" class="calc-chip" @click="testUsd = 5">$5 USD</button>
                <button type="button" class="calc-chip" @click="testUsd = 10">$10 USD</button>
                <button type="button" class="calc-chip" @click="testUsd = 25">$25 USD</button>
                <button type="button" class="calc-chip" @click="testUsd = 50">$50 USD</button>
                <button type="button" class="calc-chip" @click="testUsd = 100">$100 USD</button>
              </div>

              <!-- Resultados Simulados -->
              <div class="calc-result-box">
                <div>
                  <div style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: #71717a;">
                    En Bolívares (VES)
                  </div>
                  <div style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--brand-red); margin-top: 2px;">
                    Bs. <span x-text="formatNumber(testUsd * (rateVes || 0))"></span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="badge-pill badge-red">
                  VES
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="calc-result-box">
                <div>
                  <div style="font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: #71717a;">
                    En Pesos Colombianos (COP)
                  </div>
                  <div style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #3b82f6; margin-top: 2px;">
                    $ <span x-text="formatNumber(testUsd * (rateCop || 0))"></span> COP
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="badge-pill badge-blue">
                  COP
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Tarjeta de Políticas y Consejos Comerciales -->
          <div class="panel-card">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" style="color: #22c55e;">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                </svg>
                <span>Directrices del Negocio</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="padding: 18px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #71717a;">
              <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                  <strong>Moneda Base USD:</strong> Todos los repuestos y lotes registran su costo base en dólares americanos para proteger márgenes de ganancia.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                  <strong>Actualización Diaria:</strong> Se recomienda fijar la tasa al inicio de cada jornada laboral antes de aperturar el punto de venta (POS).
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Pagos Mixtos:</strong> El cliente puede cancelar en divisas en efectivo, pago móvil en Bolívares o transferencias en Pesos según estas tasas.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer style="padding: 20px 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--w3-border-light); font-size: 12px; color: #71717a; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;">
      <div>
        &copy; 2026 <strong>{{ _ENV['APP_NAME'] }}</strong>. Módulo de cotizaciones y tasas.
      </div>
      <div>
        Sistema de inventario por lote y trazabilidad comercial.
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
